  m_text: 'Game name: Sheep Eat Grass

    Author: HongYi Liu(Kevin)

    Student
    number: 24832449


    Game introduction: The player controls the sheep to eat
    the grass in the map, and eats 10 to win. Use WASD to move, and drag the screen
    with the mouse to rotate the viewing angle.'
